# The build context holds only what Dockerfile.player copies, so a
# change to any other file does not rebuild this image. The Go build
# reads the module files, the root package's Go sources,
# `openapi.json`, which the package embeds, and `edl/`. The final stage
# copies the test pattern files in `patterns/`.
*
!go.mod
!go.sum
!*.go
!openapi.json
!edl/
!patterns/*.mkv
# go build reads no test file or testdata.
**/*_test.go
**/testdata/
